#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/index.md:80
msgid ""
"The [Tutorials for Beginners](tutorials/index.md) section is designed for "
"users who have already installed KPP and read the [Quick "
"Start](quickstart.md) guide."
msgstr ""
"[新手教程](tutorials/index.md)一节面向已经安装 KPP 并阅读过[快速开始](quickstart.md)指南的用户。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/index.md:82
msgid "Tutorials are organized into two tracks:"
msgstr "教程分为两条路径："

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/index.md:84
msgid ""
"**Beginner Track**: Start from the [sampling "
"bottleneck](tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md) and build up to your "
"first hands‑on application: "
"[RBM classification](tutorials/rbm_classification.md) on handwritten digits."
msgstr ""
"**初学者路径**：从[采样瓶颈](tutorials/quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md)开始，逐步完成您的第一个实践教程：[RBM"
" 分类](tutorials/rbm_classification.md)。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/index.md:86
msgid "**Generative Model Track**, explore more powerful models:"
msgstr "**生成模型路径**，探索更强大的模型："

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/index.md:88
msgid ""
"**BM Generation**: Use a fully connected Boltzmann "
"Machine for fast, small‑scale data generation."
msgstr "**BM 生成**：使用全连接玻尔兹曼机进行数据生成，适合快速生成小规模样本的场景。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/index.md:89
msgid ""
"**Q-VAE (MNIST)**: A quantum‑enhanced variational autoencoder that combines a "
"variational autoencoder with a quantum Boltzmann machine for image "
"generation and representation learning."
msgstr "**Q-VAE（MNIST）**：量子增强变分自编码器，将变分自编码器与量子玻尔兹曼机相结合，用于图像生成与表征学习。"

